stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Watching: FileView watches state file
    Watching --> Parsing: file loaded or changed
    Parsing --> Published: JSON.parse succeeds
    Parsing --> Watching: invalid or empty JSON retains previous state
    Published --> Watching: update snapshot and countdown timestamp
    Watching --> Bootstrap: file missing and integration enabled
    Bootstrap --> Watching: emacsclient asks Emacs to write state
    note right of Parsing
        The file contains raw JSON.
        Lisp string decoding applies only to emacsclient report output.
    end note
